    {
      "id": "in-the-dream",
      "title": "In the dream",
      "anchor": "In_the_dream",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "in-the-dream:mbbruj",
          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Reldo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reldo</a> for a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Potion_of_dreamless_sleep\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">potion of dreamless sleep</a>.",
          "text": "Talk to Reldo for a potion of dreamless sleep.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "in-the-dream:jqdgxv",
          "html": "<i>Drink</i> the potion, then <i>inspect</i> the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dragonkin_device_(Dead_and_Buried)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">dragonkin device</a> to enter the dream.",
          "text": "Drink the potion, then inspect the dragonkin device to enter the dream.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "Enter dream."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "in-the-dream:z97c1h",
          "html": "The aim is to step on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pressure_plate_(Dead_and_Buried)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pressure plates</a>, unlock all the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Boulder_(Dead_and_Buried)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">boulders</a>, and enter the final barrier. As the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Player_(Dead_and_Buried)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">player</a>, you can push and pull boulders <b>one</b> tile at a time. As the Raptor, you can push boulders <b>five</b> tiles, and pull by <b>one</b> tile.",
          "text": "The aim is to step on the pressure plates, unlock all the boulders, and enter the final barrier. As the player, you can push and pull boulders one tile at a time. As the Raptor, you can push boulders five tiles, and pull by one tile.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "in-the-dream:z97c1h:dwqu9d",
              "html": "It might glitch and not show the boulder, although it is there and interactable.",
